OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 21 FEB
OL,4,G0600FSounds of the 60s with Tony
OL,5,     FBlackburn
OL,6,     GTony brings you two hours of
OL,7,     Gmusic from the best decade ever,
OL,8,     Gwith hits from Harpers Bizarre,
OL,9,     GThe Bachelors and Edwin Starr.
OL,10,     GThis week, the top three comes
OL,11,     Gfrom 1964.
OL,12,G0800FDermot O'Leary
OL,13,     GOscar and BAFTA nominee Rose
OL,14,     GByrne chats about her movie If I
OL,15,     GHad Legs I'd Kick You. Plus some
OL,16,     Gclassic vinyl, a wedding call and
OL,17,     GThe Mystery Voice.
OL,18,G1000FRomesh Ranganathan
OL,19,     GActor Rosamund Pike joins Romesh
OL,20,     Glive in the studio, ahead of the
OL,21,     GWest End transfer of her play
OL,22,     G'Inter Alia'.
