OL,12,     Gclassical vocal powerhouse
OL,13,     GKatherine Jenkins for a memorable
OL,14,     GKaRYoke. Also, Mummy Linda and
OL,15,     GRob Rinder will be going head to
OL,16,     Ghead in a new feature.
OL,17,G1800FShaun Keaveny
